; Regression test for GitHub issue #3320: a `check` line beneath an
; `account` directive whose own line ends in a comment applies to the
; postings of the account named before the comment.  Before the fix it
; applied to an account named after the whole line, which no posting
; used, so this check never fired.  Its warning makes this file negative,
; so it is kept apart from 3320_3.test, which the bisimulation replays.

account Expenses:Food  ; closed at the end of 2023
    check date < [2024-01-01]

2023/12/31 Market
    Expenses:Food    $5.00
    Assets:Cash

2024/01/02 Market
    Expenses:Food    $10.00
    Assets:Cash

test bal
             $-15.00  Assets:Cash
              $15.00  Expenses:Food
--------------------
                   0
__ERROR__
Warning: "$FILE", line 15: Transaction check failed: (date < [2024/01/01])
  (check expression at "$FILE", line 8)
end test
